			<div class="content" id="post-content-4847977">
									

<p>Alright, so what you have to do is go to the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-series-6">series page</a> in question, and scroll to the bottom of the page. There, you should be able to see a series of red buttons; the furthermost one on the left being the word <tt>&quot;edit&quot;</tt>. Click that, and scroll through the edit box to the slot № that you applied your article to (<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;*&#32;[[[SCP-5129]]]&#32;-&#32;[ACCESS&#32;DENIED]&#32;</span>).</p>
<p>Delete the text that says <tt>&quot;[ACCESS DENIED]&quot;</tt> and add whatever title you want. Do <em>not</em> change anything else on the page. Once finished, you can click save, and that's it. For the <tt>.aic</tt> elements like Secretary_Helen or CROM, it may take around 5 minutes to update, but Wikidot will do so instantly.</p>

